{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05173","headline":"奉别张岳州说二首 一 · 王熊","name":"奉别张岳州说二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长沙辞旧国，洞庭逢故人。\n薰兰敦久要，披雾转相亲。\n岁月空嗟老，江山不惜春。\n忽闻黄鹤曲，更作白头新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}